# A48 probe 2 (TeraDesk via #Z, 640x480): locate the ARESCH alert before
# scripting the full sequence. Probe 1 showed the VOPTIONS root at (164,113)
# (form_center out=(161,110,318,278) incl. xd_border 3 px): ST-Low (obj 4)
# = (196..299,177..192), OK (obj 20) = (316..379,353..368). Only ST-Low and
# ST-Medium are enabled: TeraDesk's `static long vdo` stays 0 without a _VDO
# cookie -> vdohi = ST_VIDEO -> vd_enable_rez(VSTMED) (video.c:60,494-507).
200 parkbr
1000 arm
1100 mark A_IDLE
1400 move 260 8
1900 mark B_OPTIONS_OPEN
2200 move 300 170
2500 down
2503 up
3100 mark C_VIDEO_DIALOG
3400 move 247 185
3700 down
3703 up
4100 mark D_STLOW_PICKED
4400 move 347 361
4700 down
4703 up
5300 mark E_ALERT
